{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"希伯來書","commonName":"希伯來書","title":"希伯來書","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"78bc9971805314997ff4566e48478a49f397d7d15fa573c9fb560ada92028478","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":303},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["這麼大的救恩"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["所以，我們當越發鄭重所聽見的道理，恐怕我們隨流失去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那藉着天使所傳的話既是確定的；凡干犯悖逆的都受了該受的報應。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我們若忽略這麼大的救恩，怎能逃罪呢？這救恩起先是主親自講的，後來是聽見的人給我們證實了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["上帝又按自己的旨意，用神蹟、奇事和百般的異能，並聖靈的恩賜，同他們作見證。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["救恩的元帥"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我們所說將來的世界，上帝原沒有交給天使管轄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但有人在經上某處證明說：",{"text":"人算甚麼，你竟顧念他？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人算甚麼，你竟眷顧他？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你叫他比天使微小一點","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜他榮耀尊貴為冠冕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並將你手所造的都派他管理，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫萬物都服在他的腳下。","poem":1},"既叫萬物都服他，就沒有剩下一樣不服他的。只是如今我們還不見萬物都服他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["惟獨見那成為比天使小一點的耶穌",{"noteId":2},"；因為受死的苦，就得了尊貴榮耀為冠冕，叫他因着上帝的恩，為人人嘗了死味。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["原來那為萬物所屬、為萬物所本的，要領許多的兒子進榮耀裏去，使救他們的元帥，因受苦難得以完全，本是合宜的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因那使人成聖的和那些得以成聖的，都是出於一。所以，他稱他們為弟兄也不以為恥，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["說：",{"text":"我要將你的名傳與我的弟兄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在會中我要頌揚你；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["又說：",{"text":"我要倚賴他；","poem":1},"又說：",{"text":"看哪，我與上帝所給我的兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["兒女既同有血肉之體，他也照樣親自成了血肉之體，特要藉着死敗壞那掌死權的，就是魔鬼，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["並要釋放那些一生因怕死而為奴僕的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他並不救拔天使，乃是救拔亞伯拉罕的後裔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["所以，他凡事該與他的弟兄相同，為要在上帝的事上成為慈悲忠信的大祭司，為百姓的罪獻上挽回祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["他自己既然被試探而受苦，就能搭救被試探的人。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：你叫他暫時比天使小","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":7}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：惟獨見耶穌暫時比天使小","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}